          "summary": "Add SFJ duty to defend and indemnity for third-party IP infringement, breach of Applicable Law and data breach; narrow PB's indemnity to PB-supplied Product and PB's breach of law.",
          "comment": "[Playbook] Our position requires SFJ to defend and indemnify us for third-party IP infringement claims, its breach of Applicable Law and data breaches it causes, so we have added those heads to Section 12.1.1. We have also narrowed Section 12.1.2 so that we indemnify SFJ only for Product we supply and our own breach of law, removing the one-way IP indemnity that currently covers SFJ's own performance.",
