            {
              "kind": "insert_after",
              "paragraphId": "p0691",
              "text": "In addition, SFJ will defend, indemnify and hold the PB Indemnified Parties harmless from any and all Losses arising or resulting from any Claims by a Third Party to the extent arising from (i) any allegation that any services, materials or deliverables provided by SFJ or any of its Affiliates or Permitted Third Parties infringe or misappropriate the Intellectual Property of a Third Party, (ii) SFJ's breach of Applicable Law, or (iii) any unauthorized access to or disclosure of PB Confidential Information or Personally Identifiable Information caused by SFJ or any of its Affiliates or Permitted Third Parties."
